  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Nordic Development Research Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the succesful completion of the 1st cycle of joint Nordic Development Research Conferences between 2011 and 2017, the Nordic Development Research Associations (NFU, FSDR and FAU) together with several Swedish institutions (Nordic Africa Institute, Development Studies at Uppsala University and Global Studies at Gothenburg University), have agreed to enter a 2nd cycle. The overall thematic framework for the 1st conference in the 2nd cycle to take place in Copenhagen from 27-28 June 2019 is Knowledge Production in North-South Collaboration: Challenges in an era of a new global divide</narrative>
  </description>
